Package: datalib
Title: Access the IHSN-Organized Survey Microdata Archive
Version: 1.9.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("Joao Pedro", "Azevedo", email = "jpazevedo@unicef.org",
             role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = "UNICEF"),
      person("Minh Cong", "Nguyen", role = "aut", comment = "World Bank"))
Description: Read (dl_get), deposit (dl_put) and validate (dl_check) survey
    microdata organized in the datalib / IHSN folder taxonomy. Mirrors the Stata
    and Python members of the datalib family; option names and values are shared
    across languages (see the taxonomy specification).
